"""Public data for the Knowledge Sprint Series index. tools/build.py turns it into every page.

Edit this file, never the generated pages. Titles, first-published dates and DOIs come from each
phase's Zenodo record; the descriptions are written from the published images.

PHASES: one entry per archived phase, in order.
  n         phase number (1-27)
  title     public phase title, exactly as on the Zenodo record
  first     date the phase's first image was posted (ISO, = Zenodo publication date)
  v, c      version DOI and concept DOI of the phase's Zenodo edition
  line      one sentence that sums up the phase (shown under the phase heading)
  result    one result checked in the phase, with its real number
  summary   file name of the phase summary image
  sprints   one entry per sprint: n, title, file, tagline (optional), covers, tryit
            covers = what the sprint teaches, one sentence; tryit = the hands-on part, with its real output

MILESTONES: overview images. after = the phase they follow in the gallery;
  archived_with = the phase whose Zenodo edition carries them.

NEXT: the phase shown as the last gallery tile (None when the series is complete).
  status "publishing" = its images are being posted; "next" = not started yet.
"""

